  "citation": "Perzan Z; Pierce S; Boye K (2022): Groundwater level elevation and temperature data, Oct 2018-Dec 2021, Slate River Floodplain, Crested Butte, CO. Groundwater Quality SFA. Dataset. doi:10.15485/1908248",
